sysible-cli (0.3.0) sysible; urgency=medium

  * Ship install-sysible from this package, at /usr/sbin/install-sysible.
    It used to live only in the ISO's includes.chroot, so no apt upgrade could
    ever replace it: every installer fix reached new images only and left the
    installed base on a broken copy. postinst takes over a stale
    /usr/local/bin/install-sysible from an older ISO, which would otherwise keep
    shadowing the packaged one on root's PATH.
  * install-sysible gains --uninstall and --reinstall, covering every product
    (containers, data volumes, checkouts and the CLI) rather than just the
    sysiblectl symlinks that `sysiblectl uninstall` removes.

 -- Sysible <maintainers@sysible.com>  Mon, 10 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000

